{
  "_comment": [
    "The projects tested by .github/workflows/grab-pipeline-compat.yml.",
    "Every key that does not start with an underscore is one matrix job.",
    "",
    "'item_name' is the list of item names the tracker would have handed",
    "out (joined with NUL, as the multi-item projects expect).",
    "'properties' seeds extra item properties an upstream task would",
    "normally have set. 'skip_tasks' names pre-download tasks that need",
    "live network and so cannot run with the network removed; CheckIP and",
    "CheckRequirements are always skipped. 'ref' pins a branch or tag;",
    "the default branch is",
    "used when it is absent. 'http' adds synthetic responses for URLs the",
    "offline sandbox does not already know, as {\"url-substring\":",
    "{\"json\": ...}} or {\"url-substring\": {\"text\": \"...\"}}.",
    "",
    "Derived from the project list served by warriorhq.archiveteam.org.",
    "Many other *-grab repos exist but are abandoned and pinned to ancient",
    "seesaw versions; this list is deliberately hand-curated."
  ],

  "ArchiveTeam/blogger-grab":                   {"item_name": ["blog:archiveteam"]},
  "ArchiveTeam/github-grab":                    {"item_name": ["web:initial:ArchiveTeam/seesaw-kit"]},
  "ArchiveTeam/imgur-grab":                     {"item_name": ["i:abcdef1"]},
